            {
              "text": "General Purpose Safekeeper cabinets are available in bench/desktop and floor-standing models. Select models are available with two, three or four independent drying chambers, each with its own filtration and control system.  Most models are designed and configured for mobile use in uncontrolled environments.  The Drugkeeper series is designed for safe storage of confiscated hazardous chemicals and illegal drugs.  The Safeswab horizontal airflow cabinet is useful for protecting biological evidence collected on swabs from external contaminants and personnel in the working environment.  The Evidence Transporter™ is an \"on-site\" fabric chamber developed for transporting evidence from the field to the lab.      Get a Quote    Shop Select Models Online",
              "html": "<div class=\"leftblock\"> <div class=\"introprodtext\"> <ul> <li>General Purpose Safekeeper cabinets are available in bench/desktop and floor-standing models. Select models are available with two, three or four independent drying chambers, each with its own filtration and control system. </li> <li>Most models are designed and configured for mobile use in uncontrolled environments. </li> <li>The Drugkeeper series is designed for safe storage of confiscated hazardous chemicals and illegal drugs. </li> <li>The Safeswab horizontal airflow cabinet is useful for protecting biological evidence collected on swabs from external contaminants and personnel in the working environment. </li> <li>The Evidence Transporter™ is an \"on-site\" fabric chamber developed for transporting evidence from the field to the lab. </li> </ul> </div> <div> <div> <a href=\"/quote-request\" class=\"button1\" role=\"button\">Get a Quote</a> </div> <div> <a href=\"https://ductless.com/forensic-lab-equipment/forensic-evidence-drying-cabinets.html\" class=\"button2\" role=\"button\" target=\"_blank\"> Shop Select Models Online </a> </div> <div> </div> </div> </div> "
